<title>USA: ReSound Corp names Arthur Taylor CFO.</title>
<headline>ReSound Corp names Arthur Taylor CFO.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>ReSound Corp said Monday it had named Arthur Taylor as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Taylor joins ReSound most recently from Allergan Inc , where he served as vice president, controller, of the company's Europe/Africa/Middle East Region.</p>
<p>ReSound was not available for commment on Taylor's predecessor.</p>
<p>ReSound provides technologically advanced hearing devices for the hearing impaired.</p>
</text>
